The above parameters from (i) to (vii) shall constitute at least 60% of the total weightage in the performance assessment matrix of MD/CEO/WTDs; and at least 30% of the total weightage in the performance assessment matrix of other KMPs individually. The weightage for each of the parameters may be configured suitably for MD/CEO/WTDs and other KMPs depending on their respective roles. Insurers may define additional parameters also which shall be in line with the business plan of the Insurer. These parameters shall be spelt out in the remuneration policy. 

